TC across 52 transactions for a total current value of $3,701,893.98 USD. Grim Spider is reportedly associated with Lunar Spider and Wizard Spider.", "firstObserved": "", "notes": "Microsoft mapping: Microsoft lists Wizard Spider under Periwinkle Tempest (Russia) and Storm-0230. Periwinkle Tempest chosen as the named Russia-origin match."}, "attribution": {"sponsor": "", "confidence": "", "basis": ""}, "objectives": "", "targeting": {"sectors": [], "regions": [], "notes": ""}, "capabilities": {"summary": "", "software": [{"id": "S0002", "name": "Mimikatz", "type": "tool"}, {"id": "S0024", "name": "Dyre", "type": "malware"}, {"id": "S0029", "name": "PsExec", "type": "tool"}, {"id": "S0039", "name": "Net", "type": "tool"}, {"id": "S0097", "name": "Ping", "type": "tool"}, {"id": "S0154", "name": "Cobalt Strike", "type": "malware"}, {"id": "S0190", "name": "BITSAdmin", "type": "tool"}, {"id": "S0266", "name": "TrickBot", "type": "malware"}, {"id": "S0349", "name": "LaZagne", "type": "tool"}, {"id": "S0359", "name": "Nltest", "type": "tool"}, {"id": "S0363", "name": "Empire", "type": "tool"}, {"id": "S0367", "name": "Emotet", "type": "malware"}, {"id": "S0446", "name": "Ryuk", "type": "malware"}, {"id": "S0504", "name": "Anchor", "type": "malware"}, {"id": "S0521", "name": "BloodHound", "type": "tool"}, {"id": "S0534", "name": "Bazar", "type": "malware"}, {"id": "S0552", "name": "AdFind", "type": "tool"}, {"id": "S0575", "name": "Conti", "type": "malware"}, {"id": "S0632", "name": "GrimAgent", "type": "malware"}, {"id": "S0659", "name": "Diavol", "type": "malware"}, {"id": "S1071", "name": "Rubeus", "type": "tool"}, {"id": "S9001", "name": "SystemBC", "type": "malware"}]}, "attack": [{"id": "T1003.001", "name": "LSASS Memory", "source": "MITRE ATT&CK G0102 (2026-07-31)", "tactics": ["credential-access"]}, {"id": "T1003.002", "name": "Security Account Manager", "source": "MITRE ATT&CK G0102 (2026-07-31)", "tactics": ["credential-access"]}, {"id": "T1003.003", "name": "NTD